<view class="page {{role}} "><view wx:if="{{denied}}" class="denied">{{denied}}<button class="primary" bindtap="home">返回首页</button></view><block wx:else><view class="heading-title">转售货款</view><view class="subtitle">库存与货款分别记录，平台代收后人工复核付款。</view><view class="note" style="margin-top:25rpx">退款会生成货款负向调整；留存部分归属未定时暂挂，不自动作为平台收入。推广奖励另行登记。</view><view class="card record" wx:for="{{payables}}" wx:key="id"><view class="row"><view class="name">{{item.name}}</view><text class="status">{{labels[item.status]}}</text></view><view class="amount">代收 ¥ {{item.amount}}</view><view class="detail-line"><text>待核定留存</text><text>¥ {{item.heldAmount}}</text></view><view class="detail-line"><text>待付货款</text><text>¥ {{item.payableAmount}}</text></view><view class="id">{{item.id}}</view></view></block></view>